{"ID":"20230927104255-ypfq352","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927104255-ypfq352","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927104255-ypfq352\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927135107-em3t8xs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927135107-upida8l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927135107-upida8l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:48,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:48\u0026#125;","title":"【赤丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927135107"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927135107-em3t8xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927135107-em3t8xs","updated":"20230927135107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：茯苓四两、乌头二两(炮)、半夏四两(洗)(一方用桂)、 细辛一两(《千金》作人参)"}]},{"ID":"20230927135107-upida8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927135107-upida8l","updated":"20230927135107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，末之，内真朱为色，炼蜜丸如麻子大，先食酒饮下三丸，日再，夜一服，不知，稍增之，以知为度。"}]}]}